# Platform build tooling lives in this one repository (mobile/ios, mobile/android,
# scripts/package_native.py). Outputs go to /target and /builds, ignored above.
# The entries below keep signing material, IDE state and platform caches out
# even when a tool writes them outside those two directories.
*.mobileprovision
*.p12
*.p8
*.cer
*.keystore
*.jks
local.properties
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
DerivedData/
*.xcarchive
*.ipa
*.dSYM/
.gradle/
*.apk
*.aab
*.dmg
*.msi
.venv/
node_modules/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log

# Engine-owned shared humanoid motion (not baked into avatar models).
